            "review_title": "Review at Thach Hoan - Bun Cha & Nom",
            "review_text": "mbtrippin\n27 contributions\n0\nGreat Food, Poor Service\nJan 2020\nBeen 3 times. \n\nThe GOOD: Bun Cha and Nem here are excellent, and served in generous portions for 30k and 5k, respectively. Beer is 15k/bottle.\n\nThe BAD: The service here needs improvement. First time everything was lovely, second time they forgot my Nem after I asked for it two times, and third time they didn't even take an order from me, just gave me some Bun Cha after sitting at my table for about 5 minutes. I started to ask for Nem and a beer and the lady walked away. Thanks a lot.\n\nNo smiles, no thank yous, nothing.\n\nI can understand how a busy environment gets stressful for the workers but I found the lack of attentiveness to a paying customer pretty rude. There was just zero effort. \n\nIf you can put up with bad service, great Bun Cha!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 7, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
